# Asuka against Jinx (#65): Asuka's picture wired as image 1 (at 1), Jinx's RefMod swept by the grid.
# Red against blue shows where the RefMod wins: in 118-121 between 0.1 (still Asuka) and 0.15 (Jinx,
# Asuka's red hair clips still on). One Generate renders every strength; seed fixed at 7.
@h3 references 2:3 0.6MP
@grid $s
$s = {0|0.05|0.1|0.11|0.12|0.13|0.14|0.15|0.2|0.3}
style: live-action, TikTok reel

CAST
@JINX (refmod minimaxh3_jinx_v1_refmod, image 1): a skinny and pretty alternative young woman around 20 years old.
SET: @JINX($s, refmods)

SHOT 5s: static
@JINX stands in front of a mirror in a small bedroom and shows her outfit.
